## 4. Mock photos (optional — user confirms count)

Apply **Image generation (AskQuestion first)** at the top of this file before any **GenerateImage** call.

When the user chooses a count **> 0**:

- Generate **exactly** that many images — no extra “just in case” assets.
- **Realistic and relevant** — each photo must match the work order issue, location, and test case (e.g. under-sink leak for plumbing, fridge nameplate for appliance make/model tests).
- **Normal quality** — clear tenant-style phone snapshots (wide shot, close-up, label as needed). One straightforward prompt per image. Do **not** over-engineer (no elaborate PIL pipelines, multi-step retries, or hyper-detailed prompts unless the test case requires readable text on a label).
- Align generated shots with **Image Descriptions** when those bullets exist; if the user asked for fewer images than descriptions, pick the most relevant ones.
- After generation, give **paths or filenames** under **`cursor_workspace/`**; do **not** claim these are real resident photos.

When the user chooses **`0 (no images)`** or **`Use existing images only`**: do **not** call **GenerateImage**. Keep **Image Descriptions** as planning text only when useful, or omit them if the scenario has no photo angle.

**Limitations:** Images are **AI-generated mockups** for testing — not evidence, not production resident uploads. If generation is **unavailable or fails**, state that in **one short line** and do **not** pretend images were produced.

---

## 5. What not to do

- Do not output bare angle-bracket templates unless the user explicitly wants an empty form.
- Do not add sections outside the structure above unless the user asks.
- Do not label the example “Sample” or “Fictional” inside the work order body unless the user wants disclaimers.

---

## 6. Quick reference (minimal shape)

If the user only wants a **short** description block without the full marketplace form, you may use a compact variant — **only when they ask for “short” or “minimal”**:

```markdown
Description:
<2-4 sentences in tenant voice>
```

Mock photos are **optional** for this minimal variant — still use **AskQuestion** before generating.

Otherwise default to the **full structure** in this file; generate mock photos **only after** the user confirms a count **> 0** (see **Image generation (AskQuestion first)**).
